Commands under `ledgers approvals`

Usage: approvals <COMMAND>

Commands:
  decide       approvals.decide
  decide-bulk  approvals.decide_bulk
  get          approvals.get
  list         approvals.list
  help         Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help
